  "bodyHash": "9736ac65e91e3719",
  "content": "\n\n<h2>Handycam 添加了细腻且受物理启发的镜头移动效果，让《我的世界》仿佛是用真实手持摄像机拍摄一般。</h2>\n<h2>效果</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>行走晃动</li>\n<li>疾跑摇摆</li>\n<li>侧移倾斜</li>\n<li>前倾</li>\n<li>鼠标延迟</li>\n<li>待机抖动</li>\n<li>呼吸</li>\n<li>受伤抖动</li>\n<li>命中冲击</li>\n<li>射箭后坐力</li>\n<li>跳跃抖动</li>\n<li>落地冲击</li>\n<li>下蹲抖动</li>\n<li>进食摇摆</li>\n<li>爆炸</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>配置</h2>\n<p>每种效果都有独立的强度滑块，并可单独关闭。可通过 <strong>ModMenu</strong>（Fabric）或游戏内模组菜单（NeoForge）打开设置。</p>\n<h2>依赖项</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ModMenu</a> <em>（仅限 Fabric）</em></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a> <em>（仅限 Fabric）</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>仅适用于客户端。在任何服务器上均可安全使用。</em></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fhandycam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/vercim/handycam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/github_vector.svg\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/cloth-config-api_vector.svg\" alt=\"Cloth Config API\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/fabric-api_vector.svg\" alt=\"Fabric API\"></a></p>",
